                    "text": "纯逻辑和宿主FS接线分离便于复用。resolveFileTarget仅在cwd已知时containment检查，调用方必须提供可信工作区；数值评分是可解释规则，命名应避免给出超出规则的语义保证。 源码依据：[lib/translation.js](https://github.com/863683348/dsh-plugin-translation/blob/2238d4d2ff479ddd0ae81d3efbff8b3ee1526854/lib/translation.js)、[lib/index.js](https://github.com/863683348/dsh-plugin-translation/blob/2238d4d2ff479ddd0ae81d3efbff8b3ee1526854/lib/index.js)。",
